          <description>If any Kastelan Robot causes an unsaved Wound, Glancing Hits or Penetrating Hits to an enemy unit using a weapon with Luminagen special rule, all Kataphron Destroyer units in this Formation that target the same enemy unit gain +1 BS and Ignore Cover special rule until the end of the phase.</description>
