        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a model equipped with a stasis field has Gone to Ground, it gains a 2++ invulnerable save, but its Weapon Skill and Ballistic Skill characteristics are reduced to 0.</characteristic>
